    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 122, left: 748, width: 492, height: 420, padding: 22, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: { left: { width: 5, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>世界观母题</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>东晋柯亭，蔡邕取柯亭竹制笛；笛声引动鉴湖千年水气，凝作六位水乡小匠，守着柯桥的山水、古镇与人情。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>核心设定 · 三缸灵脉</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>柯桥的元气藏在三口古缸：<span style={{ color: '#C8892B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>酒缸（醇）</span>·<span style={{ color: '#8C4A2F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>酱缸（鲜）</span>·<span style={{ color: '#2F5D8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>染缸（彩）</span>，由先民匠心所化，维系水乡生活底色。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>精神内核</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>越地匠心的「守」与「传」——一劈一磨的耐心、雨淋不透的坚守、千年不息的传承。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 560, left: 40, width: 1200, height: 90, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, paddingLeft: 26, paddingRight: 26, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
